# 
# | Value | Meaning |
# |-------|---------|
# | 1 | The two GPUs are reachable over xGMI, regardless of how many physical xGMI links the route traverses. |
# | 2 | The two GPUs communicate over PCIe within the same CPU NUMA node. |
